{"4290150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unabandoned: Haunted Hallways", "steam_appid": 4290150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unabandoned: Dark Hallways is an online co-op horror game for 1 to 4 players. Your task is to hunt the ghost that lurks in the hallways before it hunts you. Accomplish this by seeking and destroying cursed objects to weaken the evil apparition before dispatching it for good. Whether exploring alone or with friends, something menacing could be waiting behind every door you unlock, so remember to bring a flashlight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch you back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290150/extras/73df01090e39a3a01cec725f3fd8ec6c.poster.avif?t=1779293552\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290150/extras/73df01090e39a3a01cec725f3fd8ec6c.webm?t=1779293552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290150/extras/73df01090e39a3a01cec725f3fd8ec6c.mp4?t=1779293552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger lurks in these hallways. Be prepared to run, or you may not make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weaken the spirit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290150/extras/0b66b94711e3ef2fb20cba4eef25a9a3.poster.avif?t=1779293552\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290150/extras/0b66b94711e3ef2fb20cba4eef25a9a3.webm?t=1779293552\" type=\"video/webm; cod